+   - Run at least 200 random small test cases comparing solution against brute force
+   - Include a timing check on maximum-size inputs (based on the problem constraints)
+   - Compare outputs to find any mismatches
+3. Report any failures clearly with the input that caused them
+4. If all tests pass, state "ALL_TESTS_PASSED"
+
+If you encounter any failures, analyze them carefully but do not attempt to fix them yet - we'll do that in the next stage."""
+
+        msg_history = chat_with_agent(
+            test_prompt,
+            model=self.code_model,
+            msg_history=msg_history,
+            logging=safe_log
+        )
+
+        # Stage 4: Repair Loop (bounded)
